#: reservas/templates/reservas/inicio.html:156
msgid "Pirque, al pie de la cordillera, pertenece al territorio ancestral del pueblo picunche, una de las comunidades mapuche del Valle Central. Conectar con la naturaleza es también conectar con quienes vivieron en ella antes."
msgstr "Pirque, at the foot of the mountains, belongs to the ancestral territory of the Picunche people, one of the Mapuche communities of the Central Valley. Connecting with nature is also connecting with those who lived in it before."

